// Windows resources of mmsim.exe (configured by CMake): the application icon. Resource id 1 is
// what SDL and Explorer use for the window, taskbar and file icon.
//
// No VERSIONINFO block on purpose: the statically linked libwinpthread already carries one and
// the linker refuses two VERSION resources (it fails the release link). The version shown in
// Apps & Features comes from the installer.

1 ICON "@MMSIM_ICON_FILE@"
